  "operative_text": "Sec. 1 (adding G.L. c. 140, section 122E(a)): No person shall purchase more than 1 firearm within any 30-day period.\nSec. 1 (adding G.L. c. 140, section 122E(e)): Whoever purchases a firearm in violation of this section shall for the first offense be punished by a fine of not less than $500 or more than $1,000 and for any subsequent offense by imprisonment in the state prison for not more than 10 years."
